<title>FRANCE: DEBIS AG TO BUY CAP GEMINI SYSTEMHAUS STAKE.</title>
<headline>DEBIS AG TO BUY CAP GEMINI SYSTEMHAUS STAKE.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daimler-Benz Interservices (DEBIS) is to buy Cap Gemini's 19.6 percent stake in Debis Systemhaus in a deal which will earn Cap Gemini a 200 million franc capital gain, Cap Gemini said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The French computer services and consultancy group said the total price of the sale of the Debis Systemhaus stake would be around one billion francs.</p>
<p>The sale leaves DEBIS with 100 percent control of its computer services unit, Debis Systemhaus, and with no stake in Cap Gemini</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
